sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher
    participant UI as Teacher Dashboard
    participant Controller
    participant Policy
    participant DB as Database

    Teacher->>UI: Mark Attendance
    UI->>Controller: POST /attendance/mark
    Controller->>Policy: Verify Class Teacher Role
    Policy-->>Controller: Authorized
    Controller->>DB: Save Attendance Records
    DB-->>Controller: Success
    Controller-->>UI: Attendance Saved
    
    Teacher->>UI: Enter Exam Marks
    UI->>Controller: POST /marks/enter
    Controller->>Policy: Verify Subject Teacher Role
    Policy-->>Controller: Authorized
    Controller->>Controller: Calculate Grades
    Controller->>DB: Save Marks and Grades
    DB-->>Controller: Success
    Controller-->>UI: Marks Submitted
